	"system": {
		"description": "<p>As an action, you throw back your head and roar. All creatures within 10 feet of you must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw versus your maneuver DC or become frightened of you until the start of your next turn. Creatures who succeed on their saving throw are immune to your Bellowing Roar for 24 hours. You may use this ability a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus per long rest.</p>",
